<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Reynolds Metals said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Reynolds Metals said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns said it raised its rating of Reynolds Metals Co to an attractive rating, according to a Bear Stearns source.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Tony Rizzutto was not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
